===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[post-]][[traumatic]] [[stress]] [[disorder]]|-}}

# Any [[condition]] that develops following some [[stressful]] [[situation]] or [[event]]; such as [[sleep]] [[disturbance]], [[recurrent]] [[dream]]s, [[withdrawal]] or [[lack]] of [[concentration]].

